> UPDATE mv_pk SET a = a - 1
ERROR 0A000 cannot move tuple across partitions when a non-root ancestor of the source partition is directly referenced in a foreign key
DETAIL A foreign key points to ancestor "mv_pk1" but not the root ancestor "mv_pk".
HINT Consider defining the foreign key on table "mv_pk".
